Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:02:29.70,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs54\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,24)}▍{\r\fn得意黑\fs54}2026 美网 女单四分之一决赛
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:02:29.70,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,92)}萨巴伦卡 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}7-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}6{\r\fnTL Score\fs44}¹ {\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}3-{\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}7-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}6{\r\fnTL Score\fs44}⁷{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38} 诺斯科娃 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.23,0:00:03.65,EN,,0,0,0,,Aryna, incredible match.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.23,0:00:03.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,阿丽娜 这场球太不可思议了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.65,0:00:08.49,EN,,0,0,0,,That was some incredible tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.65,0:00:08.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,刚才的网球实在太精彩了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.04,0:00:14.11,EN,,0,0,0,,First set, you played really well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.04,0:00:14.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,第一盘你打得非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.11,0:00:16.41,EN,,0,0,0,,Second set, Linda raised her level.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.11,0:00:16.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,第二盘琳达提升了状态
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.41,0:00:18.27,EN,,0,0,0,,You were down a break in the third,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.41,0:00:18.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,第三盘你一度落后一个破发
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.27,0:00:20.43,EN,,0,0,0,,and then you went to another gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.27,0:00:20.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,随后你又提升了一个档次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.43,0:00:23.09,EN,,0,0,0,,What made the difference in that third set?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.43,0:00:23.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,第三盘是什么带来了变化
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.09,0:00:24.85,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, oh my God, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.09,0:00:24.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊 天哪 各位
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.85,0:00:25.83,EN,,0,0,0,,what a battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.85,0:00:25.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,真是一场苦战
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.83,0:00:27.47,EN,,0,0,0,,what an incredible player she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.83,0:00:27.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,她真是个不可思议的选手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.47,0:00:30.75,EN,,0,0,0,,And I'm speechless right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.47,0:00:30.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,我现在激动得说不出话来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.75,0:00:32.45,EN,,0,0,0,,because I was pushing myself to the limit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.75,0:00:32.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为我一直把自己逼到极限
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.45,0:00:34.23,EN,,0,0,0,,in this match, especially in the third set.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.45,0:00:34.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,这场比赛 尤其是第三盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.23,0:00:36.91,EN,,0,0,0,,I I honestly thought that that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.23,0:00:36.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,我当时真的以为就这样了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.91,0:00:38.45,EN,,0,0,0,,The match is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.91,0:00:38.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,比赛结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.45,0:00:39.81,EN,,0,0,0,,And probably that's what helped me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.45,0:00:39.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,可能正是这个念头帮助了我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.81,0:00:43.25,EN,,0,0,0,,to kind of like I don't know feel loose
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.81,0:00:43.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,让我 怎么说呢 放松了下来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.25,0:00:44.75,EN,,0,0,0,,and just go after my shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.25,0:00:44.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后放开手脚去击球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.75,0:00:47.81,EN,,0,0,0,,And yeah, super happy to get this win.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.75,0:00:47.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的特别开心能赢下这场球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.81,0:00:50.05,EN,,0,0,0,,Super happy. Yeah, it's tough match,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.81,0:00:50.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,特别开心 这真是一场硬仗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.05,0:00:50.61,EN,,0,0,0,,tough battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.05,0:00:50.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,一场苦战
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.61,0:00:56.61,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you guys for for honestly,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.61,0:00:56.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,真心感谢大家
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.61,0:00:58.07,EN,,0,0,0,,just for you guys being you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.61,0:00:58.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们一直做你们自己
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.07,0:00:58.67,EN,,0,0,0,,You're amazing,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.07,0:00:58.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.67,0:01:01.53,EN,,0,0,0,,and it's it's always unbelievable playing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.67,0:01:01.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,每次打球都让我感觉不可思议
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.53,0:01:02.25,EN,,0,0,0,,in front of you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.53,0:01:02.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,尤其是在你们面前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.25,0:01:05.91,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your support.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.25,0:01:05.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们的支持
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.32,0:01:10.35,EN,,0,0,0,,Match point, second serve.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.32,0:01:10.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,赛点 面对二发
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.35,0:01:14.76,EN,,0,0,0,,You go really aggressive and hit an ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.35,0:01:14.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,你大胆出手 发出了一记 ACE
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.76,0:01:16.47,EN,,0,0,0,,You haven't lost a tiebreaker here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.76,0:01:16.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,你在这里的抢七还没输过
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.47,0:01:18.77,EN,,0,0,0,,in 10 attempts at the US Open.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.47,0:01:18.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,美网十次抢七全部获胜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.77,0:01:20.43,EN,,0,0,0,,Do you get more confidence
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.77,0:01:20.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,你会因此更有信心吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.43,0:01:24.48,EN,,0,0,0,,on critical moments on this court?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.43,0:01:24.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,在这片球场的关键时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.48,0:01:25.61,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, this kind of matches,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.48,0:01:25.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,这样的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.61,0:01:29.29,EN,,0,0,0,,this kind of tie- tie breaks, and this matches
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.61,0:01:29.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,这样的抢七 这样的较量
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.29,0:01:32.83,EN,,0,0,0,,under such high pressure, definitely kind
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.29,0:01:32.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,在如此高压之下 确实
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.83,0:01:35.01,EN,,0,0,0,,of like boosting my confidence
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.83,0:01:35.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,让我更有信心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.01,0:01:37.01,EN,,0,0,0,,and my energy and my motivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.01,0:01:37.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,也让我更有能量和动力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.01,0:01:41.39,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I'm super glad that somehow I made
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.01,0:01:41.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我特别高兴能发出
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.39,0:01:42.83,EN,,0,0,0,,that ace, It was very important point.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.39,0:01:42.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,那记 ACE 那一分非常重要
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.83,0:01:45.71,EN,,0,0,0,,And it just shows that I'm ready to fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.83,0:01:45.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,这说明我已经准备好战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.71,0:01:47.96,EN,,0,0,0,,and I'm happy to see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.71,0:01:47.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很高兴看到这一点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.96,0:01:51.08,EN,,0,0,0,,Back into the semifinals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.96,0:01:51.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,你又回到了半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.08,0:01:53.21,EN,,0,0,0,,Back into the semifinals here in New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.08,0:01:53.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,又回到了纽约的半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.21,0:01:55.01,EN,,0,0,0,,What are you gonna look to work
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.21,0:01:55.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,接下来你打算练些什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.01,0:02:00.21,EN,,0,0,0,,on in the off days to improve to get ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.01,0:02:00.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,利用休息日提升状态备战
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.70,0:02:02.98,EN,,0,0,0,,Maybe a bit better game on the net,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.70,0:02:02.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,也许把网前技术练得更好些
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.98,0:02:03.54,EN,,0,0,0,,to be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.98,0:02:03.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,说实话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.54,0:02:05.28,EN,,0,0,0,,I think today couple times I approached
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.54,0:02:05.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得今天有几次我来到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.28,0:02:07.20,EN,,0,0,0,,the net but I wasn't quite ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.28,0:02:07.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,网前 但并没有完全准备好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.20,0:02:09.62,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I think we'll work a little bit extra
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.20,0:02:09.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我们会额外多练一点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.62,0:02:11.68,EN,,0,0,0,,on that part of my game.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.62,0:02:11.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我在这方面的技术
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.68,0:02:14.20,EN,,0,0,0,,But you know what, we better ask my team.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.68,0:02:14.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过 最好还是问问我的团队
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.20,0:02:15.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Maybe they have a better plan for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.20,0:02:15.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,也许他们有更好的安排
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.64,0:02:18.08,EN,,0,0,0,,but for now, I just want to you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.64,0:02:18.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,但现在我只想
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.08,0:02:22.34,EN,,0,0,0,,relax, recover, and yeah just reflect
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.08,0:02:22.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,放松 恢复 再好好回想一下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.34,0:02:23.08,EN,,0,0,0,,on what just happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.34,0:02:23.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,刚刚发生的这一切
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.08,0:02:24.18,EN,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.08,0:02:24.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,打得漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.18,0:02:25.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Go get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.18,0:02:25.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,去好好休息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.28,0:02:27.08,EN,,0,0,0,,Back into the semifinals again,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.28,0:02:27.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,再次闯入半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.08,0:02:30.22,EN,,0,0,0,,world number one Aryna Sabalenka.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.08,0:02:30.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,世界第一 阿丽娜萨巴伦卡
